# The mid-attack drop keeps every kill's EXP and silver: the tgt_no_leap opening, then A until the victory
# screen. The same temple battle pays Jian 202 EXP and 101 silver without the drop (mic_sign sign11).
include boot_from_save
include cheats_strong
peek u32 0x020B4694 exp_before
peek u32 0x020B4824 silver_before
include warp6
wait 270
poke u16 0x0228EC40 1
poke u16 0x0228ECAC 1
watch u16 0x0228EC40 hp9
watch u16 0x0228ECAC hp10
watch u16 0x0228EA24 hp4
watch u16 0x0228EA90 hp5
watch u16 0x0228EAFC hp6
